Attribution
-----------
LittleRun is an independent implementation of the LittleBit / LittleBit-2 methods.
It reads the LittleBit checkpoint format; no upstream source code is included.

- LittleBit (NeurIPS 2025), arXiv:2506.13771
- LittleBit-2 (ICML 2026), arXiv:2603.00042
- SamsungLabs/LittleBit reference implementation, https://github.com/SamsungLabs/LittleBit
  (CC BY-NC 4.0)

Model weights (not included)
----------------------------
No model weights are distributed with LittleRun. Checkpoints are downloaded separately
and keep their own licenses. The checkpoint pinned in README.md,
LittleBitLLM/littlebit-qwen3-8b-0.55bpw, is a community release (not an official
Samsung model) licensed CC BY-NC 4.0. Its base model, Qwen/Qwen3-8B, is licensed
Apache-2.0.
